Haakon Studebaker wrote:
> Do acidic corpses reduce one's satiety?

No, they increase satiation.

Wizmode test showed that even eating just acid blob corpses (which have
a very low nutrition!) while you're below satiated status will make you
satiated.

There are zero-nutrition corpses (wraith corpses) but there's no food of
negative-nutrition. But your satiation will be reduced if you puke while
having magical breathing. Your satiation might also be reduced if you eat
rotten food (but I am not quite sure about that).

